window.products.push({"id":152046,"name":"GOJOOASIS Portable Washing Machine Mini Washer 8 Programs 3 Water Level with LED Display (1.38CF)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PYn5cy14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SPECIFICATIONS - Weight: 57lbs- Dimensions: 19.7”x19.7”x31.1”- Power: AC110V/60HZ- Real capacity(kg)/(CF): 4.5kg/1.38CF- Type of water level selector: Electronic- Water inlets: 2- Drain pump: YES- Top lid: ABS- Cabinet: PP- Basement: PP- Lid color: Transparent DESCRIPTION COMPACT WASHER- A great option for compact living quarters, or people that rarely wash large loads. This powerful washing machine features a completely automatic cycle, and it runs on electricity by plugging into any standard outlet. Instead of dumping water in, or tipping it over to pour out the dirty stuff, high quality intake hoses attach to a sink faucet to make the process effortless. EXTRA LARGE LOAD- Large Capacity. Ample, honeycomb shaped inner tub can load 10 lbs at one time, which is big enough for several items at once, and will even accommodate larger garments like pairs of jeans or bed sheets. Which is great if you and your family members need something cleaned quickly for work the next day or for a night out.  A NUMBER OF FUNCTIONS- Under delay function, previous to washing, the digital timer shows your preset time but when it is washing, the digital timer shows the rest washing time. Pressing load size button, you can select appropriate level. If you need to add water during washing, you can press load size button to add. It’s a washer that does exactly what you want, the way you want. HUMANIZATION DESIGH- As an option, the user can easily select spin only, tub clean as needed. And if you want to pause the washer to let the clothes soak for as much time you want, go ahead! It will not drain the water and cancel the cycle. Great for anyone that lives where larger machines aren't possible, but also nice for other folks that would prefer to wash certain things separately!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71PYn5cy14L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOJOOASIS","source_asin":"B08JQ8493D","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-152046","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JQ8493D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JQ8493D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
