window.products.push({"id":152393,"name":"VEVOR Commercial Ice Maker 121 LB/24H Carbon Steel Commercial Ice Machine w/ 50 LB Storage Built-in 48 PCS Ice Maker Machine w/ 2 Water Inlet Modes Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BLY9nnA4L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Efficient Ice Machine: Powered by the 255W compressor, VEVOR's commercial ice maker features efficient ice making, producing about 121 lbs (55 kg) every 24 hours with its 48 PCs built-in ice tray. The storage space of this compact ice machine reaches 50 lbs (22 kg). Each ice-making cycle takes 8-15 minutes, determining whether the ice cubes are thicker or thinner. Different thicknesses serve different purposes. Sturdy & Compact Body: This eye-pleasing black commercial ice machine is composed of carbon steel shell, Cyclopentane integral foaming layer, and food-grade PP liner, providing you with a high-strength and rust&wear-resistant exterior as well as a reliable heat insulation effect. The former can enhance the durability and stability of the ice maker, while the latter will effectively stop the ice cubes from melting quickly. User-friendly Control Panel: This commercial ice maker is equipped with a panel in slope design, with which you don't need to bend over to operate any longer. It integrates multiple functions. You can adjust the thickness of ice cubes by increasing or decreasing ice-making time and make an appointment to turn it on/off by pressing the \"timer\" button. Besides, the panel contains functional indicators, including automatic cleaning, full ice stop, ice-falling reminder, mode selection, etc. 2-in-1 Water Inlet Methods: Our ice cube maker supports two water inlet modes - tap water supply and bottled water supply, satisfying the peak ice demands and reducing the impact of usage areas. It will work properly in different places wherever the power cord and tap or bottled water are ready. This commercial ice maker also comes with a water filter and drainage pipe, turning the tap water into drinkable pure water and discharging the melted ice. Well-designed Details: The water pump with a large inflow has a slight possibility of blockage, ensuring the ice-making rapid and smooth. The dense air vents for effective heat dissipation can stop the ice machine from being damaged by high temperatures and prolong its service life. Four non-skid feet at the bottom can provide stable support for the device. And an ice scoop is also offered for facilitating ice fetching.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BLY9nnA4L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VEVOR","source_asin":"B0972FPN4B","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-152393","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0972FPN4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0972FPN4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
