window.products.push({"id":152436,"name":"Refrigerator Bimetal Defrost Thermostat Replacement W10225581 for Whirlpool KitchenAid Kenmore Fridges - Replaces WPW10225581, AP6017375, PS11750673, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LIOwKHA8L._SL1001_.jpg","description":"MODEL NUMBER: W10225581 Bimetal Defrost Thermostat EASY TO INSTALL - It is made exactly fit for most top name brand( Whirlpool, KitchenAid, Kenmore ) and replaces part numbers: WPW10225581, PS11750673, 2149849 SAVE TIME SAVE MONEY - Inexpensive way to fix or repair a refrigerator PREMIUM QUALITY - The replacement part is made from durable high quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer MONEY-BACK GUARANTEE - For any reason you're not completely satisfied, you can ask for a replacement or full refund, no questions asked. SPECIFICATIONS The function of the defrost bi-metal thermostat is to clip onto the evaporator and protect your evaporator from overheating during the defrost cycle. If your refrigerator does not defrost properly you can test both the thermostat and the heater to figure out which part is at fault. For this repair, you will need a Phillips screwdriver, a 1/4 inch nut driver, a flat blade screwdriver, a pair of wire strippers, a roll of electrical tape, and a few butt splice connectors.  Works with the following models: Kenmore: 10632842010, 10632852010, 10632852011, 10632853010, 10632853011, etc Whirlpool: 3ED25DQXBW01, 3ED25DQXDN00, 3ED25DQXDW00, 3ED27DQXAN00, etc Replaces part numbers: WPW10225581, PS11750673, 2149849, 2161331, 2176066, 2188824, 2196155, 2266066, 2266067, 2315504, 2317087, etc Works with most top name brands: Whirlpool, Kenmore, KitchenAid, Maytag, Amana, Roper, Estate, Crosley, Inglis, Jenn-Air, Magic Chef Fixes the following symptoms: Fridge too warm Freezer section too warm Freezer not defrosting Freezer too cold Count on our W10225581 bimetal defrost thermostat for an unrivaled mix of durability, convenient functionality, and great value for money.  The Whirlpool brand names and logos are the registered trademarks of their respective owners. Any use of the Whirlpool brand name or model designation for this product is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51LIOwKHA8L._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ARREPONT","source_asin":"B07W1X77H7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-152436","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07W1X77H7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07W1X77H7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
