window.products.push({"id":152509,"name":"Adoolla Nugget Ice Maker, Ice-Making of 44lbs/24h, Crushed Ice Maker Machine with Self-Cleaning, Low Noise Countertop Ice Maker, Stainless Steel, Port","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":229.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ukFDly75L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NUGGET ICE :Adoolla portable ice maker produces beautiful Nugget ice .Nugget ice is easily chewable and gentle on teeth. It is perfect for soaking in drinks or red wine, allowing the drink to penetrate into the ice. Provide excellent taste during chewing PELLET ICE IN MINUTES:The efficient crushed ice maker can produce ice every 10-15 minutes and is capable of making up to 44lbs of nugget ice per day.Fully meet people's daily demand for ice.With noise level under 52dB(A),the ice maker will not disturb people's normal work and rest EASY OPERATION:Our countertop nugget ice maker control panel is very easy to operate. Take out of the ice basket and fill the water tank with water, press the 'ICE/CLEAN' button and the machine begin to make ice. The \"ADD WATER\" indicator turns on when the ice maker is lack water and the \"ICE FULL\" indicator turns on when the ice basket is full.It only takes a few steps to enjoy a cool moment with your family SELF CLEANING FUNCTION:Chewable pellet ice maker comes with an advanced self-cleaning function, press the 'ICE/CLEAN' button for 5 seconds to start the self-cleaning process.Additionally, the timing/appointment function allows for easy scheduling of the machine's working time PORTABLE MACHINE:With a height of 15.35 inches and weight of 39.68 pounds, this nugget ice maker saves space while offering ample storage capacity with a 2.4L ice basket and a 2.8L water tank. Ideal choice for bars, cold drinks shops, restaurants, seafood markets, homes, offices, and more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ukFDly75L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Adoolla","source_asin":"B0C3HPB227","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-152509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3HPB227","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3HPB227","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
